Subject: [PATCH] fs, am: EnumerateExtSaveData and GetTwlArchiveResourceInfo
 (DevMenu)

DevMenu calls these at start and got "unimplemented":
- fs:USER EnumerateExtSaveData (0x0855) and Obsoleted_3_0_EnumerateExtSaveData
  (0x0833): list the extdata folders on the emulated SD card (or the shared
  extdata on the NAND), as 4- or 8-byte IDs.
- am GetTwlArchiveResourceInfo (0x0020): DSi NAND sizes (fixed: 128 MiB total,
  32 MiB for titles, all free).

